# LF in the repository and LF in the working tree, on every platform.
#
# On `main` this was a correctness rule: `output/golden-tiny/` was a fixture that
# a test compared byte for byte, and a CRLF checkout on Windows made every
# comparison fail on a fresh clone. There is no fixture on this branch, so it is
# back to being a consistency rule — but the agents' prompts and the specs are
# read by tooling that should not have to care which machine wrote them.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.pdf binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
